## 2. Visual Checklist

### General Atmosphere
- [ ] **Background**: Is it a soft off-white (`#F8FAFC`)?
- [ ] **Contrast**: Is the text easy to read? (Headings: Deep Navy, Body: Slate).
- [ ] **No "Dark Mode"**: The page should stay light even if your system is in dark mode.

### Hero Section Alignment (UPDATED)
- [ ] **Balance**: Do the left side (Text) and right side (Form) look balanced in height and width?
- [ ] **Form Card**: Is the form card substantial enough? It now has extra padding and a minimum height.
- [ ] **Vertical Center**: Are both sides vertically centered relative to each other?

### Desktop Layout (Window > 1024px)
- [ ] **Hero Split**: content on the left, "Get the PDF" card on the right.
- [ ] **Hero Typography**: "Structure first. SaaS second." should be large and bold.
- [ ] **Layout**: Sections should have generous vertical spacing.

### Mobile Layout (Window < 640px)
- [ ] **Hero Stack**: The "Get the PDF" card should appear below the main headline and subtext.
- [ ] **Padding**: Ensure text isn't touching the screen edges.

### Components
- [ ] **Form Card**: Is it white, with a soft shadow, and clearly separated from the background?
- [ ] **Features Grid**: Are there 3 columns of cards under "This is for you"?
- [ ] **FAQ**: Do the accordions open/close smoothly?

